  - id: 2
    name: blacksmith
    displayName: "\xD4ng H\u1ECFa"
    role: "Th\u1EE3 r\xE8n"
    greeting: "Mu\u1ED1n r\xE8n g\xEC th\xEC n\xF3i, \u0111\u1EEBng \u0111\u1EE9ng
      ch\u1EAFn l\u1EEDa c\u1EE7a ta."
    greetingStranger: "H\u1EED? L\xF2 r\xE8n kh\xF4ng ph\u1EA3i ch\u1ED7 \u0111\u1EC3
      ng\u1EAFm. Mua th\xEC mua, kh\xF4ng th\xEC \u0111i."
    greetingTrusted: "Ha! \u0110\u1EE9a ch\u0103m vi\u1EC7c \u0111\xE2y r\u1ED3i.
      L\u1EEDa h\xF4m nay \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3m l\u1EAFm, v\xE0o \u0111\xE2y!"
    greetingDisliked: "L\u1EA1i l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u01A1i. Mua nhanh r\u1ED3i \u0111i,
      ta kh\xF4ng r\u1EA3nh ti\u1EBFp."
    refuseLine: "L\xF2 c\u1EE7a ta kh\xF4ng giao vi\u1EC7c cho k\u1EBB m\u1EDBi quen
      h\xF4m qua."
    shunLine: "\xD4ng H\u1ECFa quay l\u01B0ng, \u0111\u1EADp b\xFAa xu\u1ED1ng \u0111e
      th\u1EADt m\u1EA1nh nh\u01B0 kh\xF4ng th\u1EA5y ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
    options:
    - name: buy_key_small
      label: "Mua ch\xECa nh\u1ECF"
