  - id: 3
    name: healer
    displayName: "B\xE0 Di\u1EC7p"
    role: "Th\u1EA7y thu\u1ED1c"
    greeting: "Con \u0111\u1EBFn r\u1ED3i \u0111\u1EA5y \xE0. C\xF3 b\u1ECB th\u01B0\u01A1ng
      \u1EDF \u0111\xE2u kh\xF4ng?"
    greetingStranger: "\xD4i, ng\u01B0\u1EDDi l\u1EA1 h\u1EA3 con? M\u1EB7t m\u0169i
      t\xE1i nh\u1EE3t th\u1EBF kia, v\xE0o \u0111\xE2y b\xE0 xem n\xE0o."
    greetingTrusted: "Con ngoan c\u1EE7a b\xE0! B\xE0 v\u1EEBa s\u1EAFc xong n\u1ED3i
      thu\u1ED1c, \u0111\u1EC3 ph\u1EA7n con m\u1ED9t b\xE1t."
    greetingDisliked: "B\xE0 v\u1EABn ch\u1EEFa cho con, v\xEC \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 vi\u1EC7c
      c\u1EE7a th\u1EA7y thu\u1ED1c. Ch\u1EC9 v\u1EADy th\xF4i."
    refuseLine: "Vi\u1EC7c n\xE0y nguy hi\u1EC3m l\u1EAFm con. \u0110\u1EC3 khi n\xE0o
      b\xE0 hi\u1EC3u con h\u01A1n \u0111\xE3."
    shunLine: "B\xE0 Di\u1EC7p l\u1EB7ng l\u1EBD \u0111\xF3ng c\u1EEDa nh\xE0 thu\u1ED1c
      tr\u01B0\u1EDBc m\u1EB7t ng\u01B0\u01A1i."
    options:
    - name: heal
      label: "Ch\u1EEFa th\u01B0\u01A1ng"
