      label: "H\u1ECFi v\u1EC1 d\u1ECBch nh\u1EA7y"
      action: 0
      pages:
      - "Nh\u1EA7y c\u1EE7a l\u0169 Slime xanh d\xEDnh v\xE0o da l\xE0 ng\u1EE9a
