      - "C\xE2y c\u1ECF quanh l\xE0ng c\u0169ng h\xE9o d\u1EA7n. B\xE0 ngh\u0129
        c\xF3 g\xEC \u0111\xF3 d\u01B0\u1EDBi l\xF2ng \u0111\u1EA5t \u0111ang h\xFAt
