  - id: 4
    name: scholar
    displayName: "Th\u1EA7y Uy\xEAn"
    role: "Th\u1EA7y \u0111\u1ED3"
    greeting: "C\xF3 ch\xED th\xEC n\xEAn. H\xF4m nay ng\u01B0\u01A1i mu\u1ED1n h\u1ECDc
      \u0111i\u1EC1u g\xEC?"
    greetingStranger: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi l\u1EA1 v\xE0o nh\xE0 ph\u1EA3i ch\xE0o h\u1ECFi
      cho ph\u1EA3i ph\xE9p. Ng\u01B0\u01A1i t\xECm ta c\xF3 vi\u1EC7c g\xEC?"
    greetingTrusted: "Tr\xF2 c\u1EE7a ta \u0111\u1EBFn r\u1ED3i. Ng\u1ED3i \u0111i,
      ta pha \u1EA5m tr\xE0."
    greetingDisliked: "Ta v\u1EABn tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi ng\u01B0\u01A1i, nh\u01B0ng
      \u0111\u1EEBng mong ta coi ng\u01B0\u01A1i l\xE0 h\u1ECDc tr\xF2."
    refuseLine: "H\u1ECDc tr\xF2 ch\u01B0a thu\u1ED9c b\xE0i th\xEC ch\u01B0a \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
      \u0111\u1ECDc s\xE1ch qu\xFD. Ng\u01B0\u01A1i c\xF2n ph\u1EA3i r\xE8n m\xECnh
      th\xEAm."
    shunLine: "Th\u1EA7y Uy\xEAn kh\xE9p c\xE1nh c\u1EEDa th\u01B0 ph\xF2ng: \"Nh\xE0
      ta kh\xF4ng ti\u1EBFp k\u1EBB v\xF4 \u01A1n.\""
    options:
    - name: train
      label: "Luy\u1EC7n t\xE2m ph\xE1p"
      action: 3
      pages: []
      price: 0
      item: 
      param: 9
