    - name: ask_seal
      label: "H\u1ECFi v\u1EC1 \u1EA4n Ng\u0169 H\xE0nh"
      action: 0
      pages:
      - "Kim sinh Th\u1EE7y, Th\u1EE7y sinh M\u1ED9c, M\u1ED9c sinh H\u1ECFa, H\u1ECFa
        sinh Th\u1ED5, Th\u1ED5 sinh Kim."
      - "N\u0103m h\xE0nh n\u01B0\u01A1ng nhau m\xE0 v\u1EEFng. M\u1ED9t tr\u1EE5
        n\u1EE9t th\xEC c\u1EA3 \u1EA5n lung lay."
      - "\u0110\xF3 l\xE0 l\xFD do Huy\u1EC1n \u1EA8n chia n\u0103m tr\u1EE5 cho
        n\u0103m d\xF2ng h\u1ECD gi\u1EEF, ch\u1EE9 kh\xF4ng gi\u1EEF m\u1ED9t m\xECnh."
      price: 0
      item: 
      param: 0
      choices:
