  - id: 5
    name: fortune
    displayName: "C\xF4 Ng\xE2n"
    role: "Th\u1EA7y b\xF3i"
    greeting: "Ba \u0111\u1ED3ng xu l\u1EA1i rung. Ng\u01B0\u01A1i \u0111\u1EBFn
      \u0111\xFAng l\xFAc."
    greetingStranger: "...Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi mang n\u1EEDa m\u1EA3nh ng\u1ECDc. Duy\xEAn
      ch\u01B0a t\u1EDBi, ng\u1ED3i xu\u1ED1ng u\u1ED1ng ch\xE9n tr\xE0 r\u1ED3i
      \u0111i."
    greetingTrusted: "Qu\u1EBB h\xF4m nay s\xE1ng l\u1EAFm. C\xF3 ng\u01B0\u01A1i
      b\xEAn c\u1EA1nh, ta th\u1EA5y \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i r\xF5 h\u01A1n."
    greetingDisliked: "Qu\u1EBB c\u1EE7a ng\u01B0\u01A1i t\u1ED1i l\u1EAFm. Ta kh\xF4ng
      mu\u1ED1n d\xEDnh v\xE0o."
    refuseLine: "Qu\u1EBB ch\u01B0a cho ph\xE9p. Duy\xEAn gi\u1EEFa ta v\u1EDBi ng\u01B0\u01A1i
      c\xF2n m\u1ECFng l\u1EAFm."
    shunLine: "C\xF4 Ng\xE2n \xFAp ba \u0111\u1ED3ng xu xu\u1ED1ng b\xE0n: \"Qu\u1EBB
      n\xF3i ta kh\xF4ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\xECn m\u1EB7t ng\u01B0\u01A1i.\""
